# ncnn .param (text) + .parambin (binary) fuzz dictionary
# Text format:   line1 magic "7767517", line2 "<layer_count> <blob_count>",
#                then per layer "<type> <name> <bottom_count> <top_count>",
#                then blob ids, then "-23300=<...>" ParamDict keys.
# Binary format: magic int32 LE 0x7685DD, then int32 counts/layers.

